liter|ml]]) water\n* 2 volumes (500 ml) [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n\n=== Toppings (as desired) ===\n* [[Cookbook:Custard|Custard]]\n* [[Cookbook:Whipped Cream|Whipped cream]]\n* Chocolate sauce\n* Chopped [[Cookbook:Hazelnut|hazelnuts]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Whipping|Whip]] all the meringue ingredients together to soft peaks.\n# [[Cookbook:Boiling|Boil]] the water with the milk, then reduce to a [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]].\n# Drop spoonfuls of the meringue mixture into the simmering liquid. Simmer for about 4 minutes then scoop out and dry on [[Cookbook:Paper Towel|kitchen paper]] rolls.\n# Serve with toppings.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for meringue]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg white]]\n[[Category:Dessert recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using whipped cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hazelnut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Soft Boiled Meringues","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"5 weights (e.g. 100 g) egg white","sourceText":"5 weights (e.g. 100 g) egg white","amountText":"5 weights (e.g. 100 g) egg white","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"4 weights (e.g. 80 g) white granulated sugar","sourceText":"4 weights (e.g. 80 g) white granulated sugar","amountText":"4 weights (e.g. 80 g) white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 pinch salt","sourceText":"1 pinch salt","amountText":"1 pinch salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3 volumes (750 ml) water","sourceText":"3 volumes (750 ml) water","amountText":"3 volumes (750 ml) water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 volumes (500 ml) milk","sourceText":"2 volumes (500 ml) milk","amountText":"2 volumes (500 ml) milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","